    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates are delighted to offer to the market this extended three bedroom, one bathroom terraced family home. Set behind a large driveway with ample off-street parking for multiple vehicles, this exceptional home is nestled in the very heart of the ever-desirable Dublin 8. Finished to an impressive specification throughout, the property offers both luxury and practicality for modern family living.\n\nInternally, the property spans approximately 90 sqm of bright, spacious and well-presented accommodation. Briefly comprising of a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable dining area and separate living room. The rear of the home features a fully fitted kitchen and a bathroom completes the ground floor. Upstairs hosts three generously proportioned double bedrooms and a well-appointed bathroom. A standout feature of this home is the private, low maintenance rear garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nMaryland is a part of Dublin 8 that links Cork Street to James Street and Loreto Road, just off Marrowbone Lane, The property enjoys a prime position on Rosary Road, within walking distance to the Coombe & St. James' Hospitals with many shops, cafes, bars and restaurants only a stones throw away. Just a one-minute walk to public transport and within easy reach of the Digital Hub, the new Guinness Quarter and the National Children's Hospital. \n\nAI-assisted images and enhancement have been used in preparing this advertisement and does not materially alter the structure, layout or features of the property. No such enhancement is intended to mislead and original images are available within the advertisement. \n\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n\n**Open viewings by appointment only, please confirm your intention to attend, as last minute changes to times can occur**"
      },
